  "title": "The Kalinga War",
  "description": "An illustrated map of the Kalinga War, about 261 BCE: the coastal kingdom Ashoka conquered, the confession he carved on rock, the edicts he left in Kalinga instead, and Kalinga's return under Kharavela.",
